001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TDECOM.
001600 AUTHOR.              KURT MOVSESIAN.
001400 INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001300 DATE-WRITTEN.        FEB 5, 1981.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001700*REMARKS.
001800*************************************************************
001900*************************************************************
002000*                    D E C O M                              *
002100*                                                           *
002200*     HANDLES ADD, MODIFY, DELETE, AND INQUIRY OF PO        *
002300*     INSTRUCTION COMMENTS.                                 *
002400*                                                           *
002500*     THIS PROGRAM DISPLAYS A MAIN MENU WITH THE            *
002600*     FOLLOWING FUNCTIONS:                                  *
002700*       1.  INQUIRY - ENTER COMMENT NUMBER AND SCROLL       *
002800*                     THROUGHT COMMENTS.                    *
002900*       2.  ADD     - ENTER INSTRUCTION NUMBER AND ADD      *
003000*                     UNLIMITED NUMBER OF COMMENT LINES.    *
003100*                     PRINT MAY BE EXPANDED, COMPRESSED,    *
003200*                     OR REGULAR TYPE.                      *
003300*                         DATABASE UPDATE:                  *
003400*                           DBPUT    - DCOMMENT             *
003500*                           DBPUT    - MCOMMENT             *
003600*       3.  MODIFY  - ENTER INSTRUCTION NUMBER AND MODIFY   *
003700*                     ANY OR ALL LINES, INCLUDING DELETION  *
003800*                     AND ADDITION OF COMMENT LINES.        *
003900*                     INSTRUCTION NUMBER AND PRINT TYPE     *
004000*                     MAY NOT BE MODIFIED.                  *
004100*                         DATABASE UPDATE:                  *
004200*                           DBPUT    - DCOMMENT             *
004300*                           DBDELETE - DCOMMENT             *
004400*                           DBUPDATE - DCOMMENT             *
004500*       4.  DELETE  - ENTER INSTRUCTION NUMBER AND ALL      *
004600*                     COMMENT LINES WILL BE DELETED FROM    *
004700*                     THE DATABASE.                         *
004800*                         DATABASE UPDATE:                  *
004900*                           DBDELETE - DCOMMENT             *
005000*                           DBDELETE - MCOMMENT             *
005100*************************************************************
005200*************************************************************
005300*     CALLED PROGRAMS:                                      *
005400*        1.  TBLOWUP -  ABORTS PROGRAM CLEANLY              *
005500*        2.  TSCRPRT2 - PRINTS SCREEN CONTENTS              *
005600*                                                           *
005700*************************************************************
005800*************************************************************
006000*************************************************************
006100*************************************************************
006200*                   HISTORY OF PROGRAM CHANGES              *
006300*************************************************************
006400*************************************************************
      *C 10/31/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C  ADD FUNCTION KEY 5 TO CALL TRCVINST FOR RECEIVING
      *C  STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS MAIN MENU.
007428
007600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
007700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
007800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.   I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

002000 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MCOMMENT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1801
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MCOMMENT-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1801
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DCOMMENT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DCOMMENT-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

002100 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MCOMMENT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MCOMMENT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1801.

       FD  MCOMMENT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MCOMMENT-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1801.

       FD  DCOMMENT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCOMMENT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1901.

       FD  DCOMMENT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCOMMENT-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1901.

008200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X VALUE SPACES.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK  OF COPYLIB.

       COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.

