008400*                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                *
008500*************************************************************
009400*----------  USED TO CONVERT INSTRUCTION NUMBER INTO SEARCH ARG
009500 01  BUILD-COMMENT-NO.
009600     05  BUILD-COM-PREFIX       PIC X       VALUE "C".
009700     05  BUILD-COM-NO           PIC X(3)    VALUE SPACES.
       01  FORM-NAME.
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(4)    VALUE "HELP".
           05  HELP-FORM-COUNTER      PIC 9(2)    VALUE ZEROES.
       01  DE1-FIELDS.
           05  DE1-MESSAGE-LINE       PIC X(79)   VALUE SPACES.
