010200*************************************************************

       01  COMMENT-HOLD-AREA.
           05  COMMENT-PAGE OCCURS 7 TIMES.
               10  COMMENT-LINE OCCURS 14 TIMES   PIC X(72).

       01  PAGE-CTR  PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
       01  CURRENT-PAGE-CTR PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
       01  LINE-CTR  PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.

011800
011900*----------  FLAGS USED TO KEEP TRACK ON WHETHER THERE ARE
012000*            MORE AND/OR PREVIOUS RECORDS TO DISPLAY.
012100 01  DATASET-PLACE                 PIC 9  VALUE 0.
012200     88  PREVIOUS-ONLY                    VALUE 1.
012300     88  MORE-ONLY                        VALUE 2.
012400     88  PREV-AND-MORE                    VALUE 3.
012500     88  NO-PREV-OR-MORE                  VALUE 4.
012600
012700 01  COMPRESSED-PRINT        PIC X(5) VALUE "*CMP*".
013000
013100 01  EXPANDED-PRINT          PIC X(5) VALUE "*EXP*".
013500*************************************************************
013600*             WORK AREAS FOR ADD FUNCTION                   *
013700*************************************************************
013800
013900*----------  USED TO COMPARE IF PRINT TYPE HAS BEEN CHANGED
014000 01  SAVE-P                        PIC X  VALUE SPACE.
014100
014200*----------  SEQUENCE NUMBER FOR ADDING TO DCOMMENT
014300 01  SEQ-NO-SAVE                   PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROES.
014400
014500*----------  FLAGS FOR EXPANDED, COMPRESSED, AND REGULAR PRINT
014600 01  PRINT-FLAG                    PIC 9  VALUE 0.
014700     88  EXP-PRINT                        VALUE 1.
014800     88  COMP-PRINT                       VALUE 2.
014900
015000*----------  WORK AREA FOR ADD FUNCTION
015100 01  CONTINUE-FLAG                 PIC 9  VALUE 0.
015200     88  CONTINUING-INSTRUCTION           VALUE 1.
015300*************************************************************
015400*               WORK AREAS FOR MODIFY FUNCTION              *
015500*************************************************************
015600*----------  KEEPS TRACK OF NEXT LINE NUMBER TO STORE IN THE
015700*            DATASET FOR WHEN NUMBERS GET OUT OF ORDER BY
015800*            ADDING/DELETING COMMENT LINES.
015900 01  LINE-SAVE                     PIC 9(4)   VALUE ZEROES.
016000
016700*----------  SUBSCRIPT INTO MODIFY SCREEN BUFFER
016800 01  M                             PIC 9      VALUE ZEROS.
017000*************************************************************
017100*                 CALLED  ROUTINES                          *
017200*************************************************************
018000
018100*---------- VSETERROR AND VPUTWINDOW
018200 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER            PIC X(76)    VALUE SPACES.
018300 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER-RD REDEFINES MESSAGE-BUFFER.
018400     05  MSG-BUFFER            PIC X(68).
018500     05  MSG-VALUE             PIC X(8).
018600 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76    COMP-4.
018700 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 0     COMP-4.
018800 01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1     COMP-4.
018900
