           05  INQUIRE-COMMAND-LINE   PIC X(79).
           05  INQUIRE-MSG-LINE       PIC X(79).
024800
024900 01  SCREEN-ADD.
025000     05  ADD-NUM                PIC X(3).
           05  ADD-SUBJECT            PIC X(3).
025100     05  ADD-LINES OCCURS 4 TIMES INDEXED BY L.
025200         10  ADD-FIRST          PIC X(36).
025300         10  ADD-LAST           PIC X(36).
025400     05  ADD-X                  PIC X.
025500     05  ADD-P                  PIC X.
           05  ADD-COMMAND-LINE       PIC X(79).
           05  ADD-MSG-LINE           PIC X(79).
025600
