026100         10  MOD-FIRST          PIC X(36).
026200         10  MOD-LAST           PIC X(36).
026300     05  MOD-X                  PIC X.
           05  MOD-COMMAND-LINE       PIC X(79).
           05  MOD-MSG-LINE           PIC X(79).
026400
026500 01  SCREEN-MOD.
           05  SCREEN-MOD-NUM                 PIC X(3).
