082100           MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
082110           MOVE  30 TO LANG-MSGNUM
082120           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
082300           MOVE 1 TO FIELD-NUMBER
                 MOVE B"1" TO IND(FIELD-NUMBER) IND(99)
                 MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER  TO ADD-MSG-LINE
082400*          PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
082500           GO TO 205-SHOW-FORM.
082600
082700     IF CONTINUING-INSTRUCTION
082800     IF ADD-P NOT = SAVE-P
      *  PRINT TYPE CANNOT BE CHANGED WHILE STILL ADDING INSTRUCTION NO
082900        MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM
082910        MOVE  32 TO LANG-MSGNUM
082920        PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
083100        MOVE 11 TO FIELD-NUMBER
083200*       PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
              MOVE B"1" TO IND(FIELD-NUMBER) IND(99)
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ADD-MSG-LINE
083300        GO TO 205-SHOW-FORM.
083400
083500     IF NOT CONTINUING-INSTRUCTION
083600        MOVE ADD-P TO SAVE-P.
083700
083800*----------  CHECK MESSAGE LENGTH FOR TYPE OF PRINT
083900     IF ADD-P NOT = "E"
084000        GO TO 215-ADD-TO-DATABASE.
084100     MOVE 0 TO FIELD-NUMBER.
084200     IF ADD-LAST (1) NOT = SPACES
084300        MOVE 3 TO FIELD-NUMBER
084400     ELSE
084500        IF ADD-LAST (2) NOT = SPACES
084600           MOVE 5 TO FIELD-NUMBER
084700        ELSE
084800           IF ADD-LAST (3) NOT = SPACES
084900              MOVE 7 TO FIELD-NUMBER
085000           ELSE
085100              IF ADD-LAST (4) NOT = SPACES
085200                 MOVE 9 TO FIELD-NUMBER.
085300
085400     IF FIELD-NUMBER NOT = 0
      **   E10: EXPANDED PRINT CAN ONLY CONTAIN 36 CHARACTERS PER LINES
085500        MOVE   5 TO LANG-SETNUM
085510        MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
085520        PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
085700*       PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
              MOVE B"1" TO IND(FIELD-NUMBER) IND(99)
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ADD-MSG-LINE
085800        GO TO 205-SHOW-FORM.
086000*----------  ADD COMMENT TO DATABASE.  IF THIS IS THE FIRST TIME
086100*            THRU, ADD COMMENT TO MASTER DATASET MCOMMENT.  IF
086200*            THIS IS A CONTINUING SCREEN, ADD ONLY TO DETAIL
086300*            DATASET DCOMMENT.
086400 215-ADD-TO-DATABASE.
086500     IF CONTINUING-INSTRUCTION
086600        GO TO 220-DCOMMENT.
086700
086800     MOVE BUILD-COMMENT-NO         TO MCOM-COMMENT-NO.
           MOVE ADD-SUBJECT              TO MCOM-SUBJECT-CODE.
           MOVE ZEROS TO COND-WORD.
