           IF FILE-STATUS  NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
087500     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
087600        MOVE "DBPUT MCOMMENT 215 DECOM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
087700        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

           MOVE ZEROS TO SEQ-NO-SAVE.
088200
088300*-----------  ADD LINES TO DCOMMENT
088400 220-DCOMMENT.
088500     SET L TO 1.
089100
089200*----------  PUT INSTRUCTION INTO DCOMMENT ALONG WITH CORRECT
089300*            ESCAPE SEQUENCE IF EXPANDED OR COMPRESSED PRINT.
089400 225-ADD-LINES.
089500     IF ADD-LINES (L) = SPACES
089600        GO TO 227-CHECK-IF-FINISHED.
