089900        MOVE ADD-FIRST (L) TO EXP-DATA-COMMENT
090000        MOVE EXPANDED-PRINT TO EXP-PRT-START
090100*       MOVE REG-5 TO EXP-PRT-STOP
090200     ELSE
090300        IF ADD-P = "C"
