093300     IF ADD-X = "X"
093400        MOVE 1 TO CONTINUE-FLAG
093500     ELSE
093600        MOVE 0 TO CONTINUE-FLAG.
093700
093800     IF CONTINUING-INSTRUCTION
093900         MOVE SPACES TO ADD-LINES (1), ADD-LINES (2),
094000                        ADD-LINES (3), ADD-LINES (4), ADD-X
      *  CONTINUE ENTERING INSTRUCTION CONTENT
