           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MCOM-SUBJECT-CODE TO MOD-SUBJECT.
106600     MOVE SCREEN-MOD-NUM TO MOD-NUM.
106700     MOVE 1 TO M.
           MOVE 0 TO PRINT-FLAG.
106900     MOVE ZERO TO SEQ-NO-SAVE, LINE-SAVE.
