           PERFORM 500-FIND-DCOMMENT-I.
           IF NO-ENTRY
               GO TO 312-WRITE-SCREEN
           ELSE
               PERFORM 500-GET-DCOMMENT-I.
107800
107900     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
108000        MOVE "DBGET1 DCOMMENT 305 DECOM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
108100        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
108200
108300     MOVE 0 TO PRINT-FLAG.
